    "text": "!main.c\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(int argc, const char * argv[])\n{\n    // try changing the initial value to change the\n    //    output of the program\n    int v = 0;\n\n    if (v > 0) {\n        printf(\"Positive\\n\");\n    }\n    else if (v < 0) {\n        printf(\"Negative\\n\");\n    }\n    else {\n        printf(\"Zero\\n\");\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n",
